  "details": "Since the last build a timeout/connection error will cause the client to properly rejoin the instance you were last in. Much appreciated.\n\nHowever, if the instance you've timed out from is a friends+ and you no longer have a friend in the instance, the rejoin hits a forbidden error and kicks the user back to their home world.\n\nThis should be considered a bug. The user already had access to the instance before and should be allowed to rejoin, even if they no longer have a friend present in the instance.\n\nI have been disconnected from active conversations and been unable to rejoin because of this error. Please override the permissions check when the rejoin is from a timeout/connection error issue. Thanks",
